   Communications},
Year = {2024},
Note = {International Technical Conference on Circuits/Systems, Computers, and
   Communications (ITC-CSCC), Okinawa, JAPAN, JUL 02-05, 2024},
Abstract = {In the era of virtual education, the integration of immersive platforms
   like DutaVerse into academic ecosystems holds immense potential for
   enriching the learning experience. This paper explores the integration
   of DutaVerse with the Cultural Exhibition Hall within the Metaverse
   Academic Nexus Virtual Education Ecosystem. Leveraging DutaVerse's
   immersive capabilities and the Cultural Exhibition Hall's educational
   resources, the integration aims to create a dynamic learning environment
   that fosters cultural exploration and engagement. Through a systematic
   approach involving technical integration, content mapping, and user
   experience design, this research proposes a method for seamlessly
   integrating DutaVerse into the Cultural Exhibition Hall. The resulting
   integrated platform offers students, educators, and cultural enthusiasts
   a unique opportunity to explore diverse cultural heritage within the
   virtual education ecosystem. Evaluation of the integration's
   effectiveness through user feedback and performance metrics demonstrates
   its potential to enhance cultural understanding and enrich the
   educational experience within the Metaverse Academic Nexus.},
Publisher = {IEEE},
